{"id":"24.09.Find100Cats","contentHtml":"<p>The project was born from market analysis and finding a free niche: I adapted the popular Steam hit <code>Find 100 Cats</code> for a mobile audience, supplementing it with meta-mechanics and \"juicy\" feedback.</p>\n<p>Worked as a <mark>Solo Developer</mark>, collaborating with an artist to create content. I was responsible for <strong>100%</strong> of all technical and product aspects: from architecture and ASO in 13+ languages to creating playable ads.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The main task was not just to copy, but to <mark>adapt it for the mobile F2P market</mark>. This required solving two key problems: how to stand out among thousands of other casual games and how to retain an audience accustomed to short sessions. It was necessary to create a product successful in the long term, not for one day.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<p>For this, I developed a comprehensive product and technical strategy aimed at retaining and attracting players.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Deepening Gameplay and Long-term Retention:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>To increase engagement and average session length, I designed a <strong>two-stage level structure</strong> unique to the genre: first, the player looks for cats, and then — hidden objects in the same location.</li>\n<li>For long-term retention, meta-mechanics were introduced: a system of hidden collectible items, as well as achievements and global leaderboards via <code>Google Play Games</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Creating Unique Experience and Winning Audience:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>To create \"juicy\" and memorable gameplay, I implemented complex tactile feedback for every press: a cascade of <code>VFX</code>, <code>Haptic vibrations</code>, sounds, animations, and camera shake.</li>\n<li>The visual style was enhanced by a custom shader with a paper effect, the effectiveness of which was <mark>confirmed via A/B tests</mark> in <code>Firebase Remote Config</code>.</li>\n<li>For maximum coverage, I conducted <code>ASO</code> optimization in <strong>13+ languages</strong> and independently <mark>created advertising creatives, including playable ads</mark> in <code>HTML</code>, <code>CSS</code>, and <code>JS</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Technical Foundation for Live-Ops:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>To maintain player interest with constant updates, I built a flexible content pipeline. All game logic was separated from content, and levels and localizations were delivered from the server \"on demand\" via <code>Addressables</code> and <code>Google Cloud</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>High Retention:</strong> Two-stage levels and meta-game significantly increased session length and player engagement.</li>\n<li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> ASO and support for 13 languages ensured the game wide organic coverage.</li>\n<li><strong>Operational Flexibility:</strong> Architecture on <code>Addressables</code> allowed quickly adding new levels, maintaining audience interest without store reviews.</li>\n<li><strong>Expertise in F2P Operations:</strong> Gained experience in the <strong>full cycle of F2P game operations</strong> — from turning analytics into product hypotheses to independently creating <code>playable ads</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Find 100 Cats & Items","date":"2024-09","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Puzzle","Unity","C#","Photoshop","Illustrator","Audacity","HLSL","VFX","Zenject (Extenject)","UniTask","GamePush","Firebase (Analytics, Crashlytics, Config, Messaging)","Odin Inspector","Google Play Games","Addressables","Unity Localization","Unity Notifications","Unity Purchasing","DOTween","IronSource"],"heroVideo":["WJNVy5wst2Q"],"shortDescription":"<p>Adapted a PC hit for the mobile market. Key solution: <mark>implemented unique two-stage gameplay</mark>, significantly increasing player retention.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://grindset.space/find-100-cats/","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.GrindsetStudios.FindCats"],"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/card.mp4?v=1765046929379","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/1.webp","width":1080,"height":1920},{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/2.webp","width":1080,"height":1920},{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/3.webp","width":1080,"height":1920},{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/4.webp","width":1080,"height":1920},{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/5.webp","width":1080,"height":1920},{"src":"/images/projects/24.09.Find100Cats/screenshots/6.webp","width":1080,"height":1920}]}